Description: dstat-go is a from-scratch Go implementation of dstat 0.8.0.
 Command-line options, column order, headers, units, colours and CSV output
 follow upstream dstat; data comes from /proc and /sys.  The binary is static
 and has no Python or plugin runtime dependency.
 .
 It installs as /usr/bin/dstat-go and is safe to install alongside the
 dstat package shipped by the distribution.

